        "summary": "Accused of a crime he did not commit - CJ Elephant is imprisoned in a Zoo. Using advanced peanut propelling weaponry, an uncanny ability to find explosive charges and a handy umbrella he promptly escapes. \n \nNow he must flee London, push on to Paris, across the Alps and career through Cairo until he finally makes it home to Africa.",
