        "id": 46325,
        "name": "Sassou Shounen Eiyuuden: Coca-Cola Kid",
        "summary": "Coca-Cola kid is a sidescroller starring the Coca-Cola Kid, the Coke mascot in Japan in the 1990's.\nCokey must hit the streets and take on Team Evil who just went and kidnapped his teacher, Ms. Sakurako. Skate through the city and be brave!",
